Let word be "   -42".
Let n be the number of characters in word.
Let i start at 0.
While i < n and character i of word is 32:
    Add 1 to i.
Let negative be false.
If i < n and character i of word is 45:
    Set negative to true.
    Add 1 to i.
If i < n and character i of word is 43:
    Add 1 to i.
Let value start at 0.
While i < n and character i of word is at least 48 and character i of word is at most 57:
    Set value to value * 10 + character i of word - 48.
    Add 1 to i.
If negative:
    Set value to 0 - value.
If value > 2147483647:
    Set value to 2147483647.
If value < -2147483648:
    Set value to -2147483648.
Print value.
